problem: Inval 4.001
argument: forall x exists y F(xy).  ~exists x F(xx)  .:  forall x forall y (F(xy)->F(yx))

problem: Inval 4.002
argument: exists x exists y F(xy).  forall y (exists x F(xy)->forall x F(xy))  .:  forall x F(xx)

problem: Inval 4.003
argument: forall x exists y forall z (R(zy)<->Gz&R(zx))  .:  exists x forall y (R(yx)<->Gy)

problem: Inval 4.004
argument: forall x (Fx->exists y (Gy&R(xy)))  .:  forall x (Gx->exists y (Fy&R(yx)))

problem: Inval 4.155
argument: forall x forall y forall z (F(xy)&F(yz)->F(xz)).  forall x forall y (F(xy)->F(yx))  .:  forall x F(xx)

problem: Inval 4.156
argument: exists x exists y F(xy)  .:  exists y F(yy)

problem: Inval 4.157
argument: forall x exists y (F(xy)|F(yx))  .:  forall x exists y F(xy)

problem: Inval 4.160
argument: forall x F(xA(x))  .:  exists x F(A(x)x)

