problem: Inval 5.001
argument: exists x forall y (Fy&Gy<->x=y)  .:  exists x forall y (Fx&(Gy<->x=y))

problem: Inval 5.002
argument: forall x (Fx->exists y forall z (Gz&R(xz)<->y=z)).  forall x (Gx->exists y forall z (Fz&R(xz)<->y=z))  .:  forall x forall y (Fx&Gy&R(xy)->R(yx))

